Still: separate Windows product, profile, COM registrations, and packages.

Apply after Helium Windows preparation. Preserve security service methods,
caller validation, sandbox configuration, updater signatures, and package checks.
Use UUIDv5(uuid5(NAMESPACE_DNS, "com.jacobcamino.still.windows"), identity_name)
for the distinct service/install identities. The new product has no legacy
Chromium/Helium COM registrations to migrate. Signed Still updates require a
Still release appcast and the existing WinSparkle signing configuration.
Keep internal helium.7z/Helium-bin names for installer compatibility.

